iv style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.6;color:#0D1725;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;word-break:keep-all;margin-bottom:8px\">数据<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">多</span>跑路，考<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">生</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">少</span>跑腿</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">shùjù duō pǎolù, kǎoshēng shǎo pǎotuǐ</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">데이터가 많이 돌아다니고, 수험생은 발걸음을 덜 합니다.</div><div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">오늘 배운 多와 少가 동사 앞에 놓여 &#x27;많이 ~하다&#x27;, &#x27;적게 ~하다&#x27; 로 쓰였습니다.</div><div style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">多</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">duō</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">많다, 많이</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">少</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">shǎo</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">적다, 적게</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">数据</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">shùjù</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">데이터</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">考生</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">kǎoshēng</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">수험생</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">跑腿</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">pǎotuǐ</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">발로 뛰어 심부름하다</span></div></div><div style=\"margin:8px 0\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/day37-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/day37-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div><div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFBWU2RSNnctSUhpYk5JYXJtV2RET0pIUEhrbWhaU25PR3NPMXBoVURZcV91dl9YZ2YwWS03T2Q0OW9jUjZ4ZDhGOE9sWnlPT2cyZ3ZkcGtpbTlTS29oZFNnMGlIUQ?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">湖南红网</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div></div><div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\"><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">小</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">xiǎo</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">작다, 어리다</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">多</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color:#8C6423;white-space:nowrap\">duō</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px\">많다</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;font-size:22px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">少</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;padding:10px 8px;color: